{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/2893","id":4800747005,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGhPPJ88AAAABHiWV_Q","html_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pull/2893","diff_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pull/2893.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pull/2893.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/issues/2893","number":2893,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Document bounded fixes for QA kit v0.3.0","user":{"login":"Ryosuke-Asano","id":73892113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkyMTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73892113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryosuke-Asano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The supplied QA kit could exhaust memory on a huge attempt number, accept incomplete or failed mozlog traces, and block past its stdin deadline. This docs-only change preserves the original input and submits a separately identified repair archive with a readable patch and reproducing regressions.\n\nThe input is `docs/Floorp_QA_Implementation_Kit_v0.3.0.zip` from commit `87311566a225936fbe7948db142bce3f1d3379d8`, 150471 bytes, SHA256 `a4af60380399050f82465864734391227ab34024d26bdf16c31559e2824a8d50`. The repaired archive is `review-fixes.1`, 158581 bytes, SHA256 `60ad9a63c9fa7e328cc2da41187c6b725a64ee6144aaac8f66c2ebc3260710f2`. Original DESIGN and all 14 documents remain byte-identical. The repair note distinguishes the limited fixes from unresolved evidence contracts.\n\nThe three repairs bound attempt/history inputs, require resolved suite selection and positive assertions with typed child exits while rejecting retries/unknown events, and read Agent stdin nonblocking against one absolute deadline. [Runtime #84](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pull/84) separately adds the minimal typed-child-exit fix; its follow-up head is `460106115bc76b026c8bf8dad24df7fcb07f97c2`.\n\nValidation: original **114 PASS**, repaired **130 PASS** (16 added regression methods), and **130 PASS** from a fresh safe expansion of the final ZIP. CRC, 60-entry/59-manifest checks, exact patch reconstruction, original Git blob and evidence hashes pass. Related existing checks are Runtime **162 PASS**, Floorp contracts **16 PASS** and fixed source plan **106 PASS**. Two independent reviewers found no new blocker; their separate boundary/pipe fixtures and reviewed code hashes are included. Initial regression and whole-suite failures remain unmodified with the recorded outer-envelope corrections. Runtime targeted Ruff/mach checks pass; full mach lint remains blocked by a sparse lockfile dependency.\n\nSee [the review record](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/blob/d9e03b8c4ccf84a52db8a7532fdd8e3fd1157f89/docs/qa/kit-v0.3.0-review-fixes/README.md) and its indexed evidence. The kit is not installed into active Floorp tools, workflows or the existing source job. Dedicated worker/supervisor isolation, authenticated source-cohort evidence and all native/final signed artifact QA remain incomplete. **Draft review is Go; native launch and publication remain No-Go/UNVERIFIED.** No Blacksmith provisioning or paid Blacksmith run, private Runtime Debug dispatch, merge, signing, notarization or release was performed.\n\nThe initial Draft automatically triggered existing Floorp integration run [37933791186](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/actions/runs/37933791186): host smoke and three artifact intake jobs completed, and the Linux combined browser suite started. The pre-push inspection missed that native continuation. The owned run was stopped; REST confirms completed/cancelled. This partial run is not accepted qualification or a verified browser test count. The documentation correction triggered [run 37934603330](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/actions/runs/37934603330) on final head `d9e03b8c4ccf84a52db8a7532fdd8e3fd1157f89`; REST confirms completed/cancelled, with cancellation during smoke before the native matrix executed. No private Runtime Debug build was dispatched.\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T13:00:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T13:11:18Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"842c9a208c77e8c8f09104f472003f005e28fcce","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/2893/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/2893/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/issues/2893/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/statuses/d9e03b8c4ccf84a52db8a7532fdd8e3fd1157f89","head":{"label":"Floorp-Projects:codex/qa-kit-v030-review-fixes","ref":"codex/qa-kit-v030-review-fixes","sha":"d9e03b8c4ccf84a52db8a7532fdd8e3fd1157f89","user":{"login":"Floorp-Projects","id":94953125,"node_id":"O_kgDOBajepQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94953125?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Projects","html_url":"https://gith